[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2581.109, "timestamp": "00:43:01", "text": "我不想要那種花哨的蛋糕"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2583.349, "timestamp": "00:43:03", "text": "之類的。我只是想做個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2585.75, "timestamp": "00:43:05", "text": "紙杯蛋糕、一個小蠟燭之類的東西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2588.63, "timestamp": "00:43:08", "text": "所以，明年我就會擁有它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2590.87, "timestamp": "00:43:10", "text": "今年我沒有，因為我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2595.03, "timestamp": "00:43:15", "text": "準備得不夠充分。嗯，不過"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2599.27, "timestamp": "00:43:19", "text": "明年嘛，嗯，大概吧，嗯，嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2601.51, "timestamp": "00:43:21", "text": "我們會一起做的。如果可以的話，我也會嘗試用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2604.79, "timestamp": "00:43:24", "text": "手持攝影機之類的裝置拍攝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2636.79, "timestamp": "00:43:56", "text": "呃，明年從日本出發。是的，我們會一起吹熄蠟燭。  VA，祝你生日快樂！阿拉托，謝謝你的生日祝福。感謝大家的生日祝福。  Takisan Bacon，謝謝你的生日祝福。感謝大家的生日祝福。藍色外星人，謝謝你們的生日祝福。克洛諾斯，我的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2639.062, "timestamp": "00:43:59", "author": "@MRTEDDY-1401", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/v510NQZUUxn-kYA-mj4sLnvLBE_ct_gKXcimoMlgGatkEuNTMrDun0C850mLX7-pcFASlbfp7ys=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "may god bless you 🥳🥳🥳"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2639.99, "timestamp": "00:43:59", "text": "天。你好。"}]